      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "def main():\n    # input the array size and its element\n    n = int(input(\"Enter the size of the array\"))\n    nums = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        nums.append(int(input()))\n    \n    q_n = int(input(\"Enter the queries size\"))\n    queries = []\n    for i in range(q_n):\n        queries.append(int(input()))\n    \n    # Create a HashMap\n    hashmap = {}\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        curr_ele = nums[i]\n        if curr_ele in hashmap:\n            hashmap[curr_ele] += 1\n        else:\n            hashmap[curr_ele] = 1\n    \n    # Iterate for queries\n    for i in range(q_n):\n        check_ele = queries[i]\n        if check_ele in hashmap:\n            print(\"Occurence of\",curr_ele,\"is this no. of times :\",hashmap[check_ele])\n        else:\n            print(\"Occurence of\",curr_ele,\"is this no. of times : 0\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()",
      "fontSize": 39,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "def main():\n    # input the array size and its element\n    n = int(input(\"Enter the size of the array\"))\n    nums = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        nums.append(int(input()))\n    \n    q_n = int(input(\"Enter the queries size\"))\n    queries = []\n    for i in range(q_n):\n        queries.append(int(input()))\n    \n    # Create a HashMap\n    hashmap = {}\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        curr_ele = nums[i]\n        if curr_ele in hashmap:\n            hashmap[curr_ele] += 1\n        else:\n            hashmap[curr_ele] = 1\n    \n    # Iterate for queries\n    for i in range(q_n):\n        check_ele = queries[i]\n        if check_ele in hashmap:\n            print(\"Occurence of\",curr_ele,\"is this no. of times :\",hashmap[check_ele])\n        else:\n            print(\"Occurence of\",curr_ele,\"is this no. of times : 0\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()",
